{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cascade is a game which has interactive simulated fluids and landscapes you can modify while on a mission or in the level editor. Use aircraft, boats, wheeled vehicles, horses, snowmobiles, Choose a creative mode or an mission driven path with challenges that include drones, turrets, monsters, bases to attack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are single player missions that involve first person characters, horse back, aircraft, driving, boats and more. these involve\u00a0 challenges of exploration, quests, attack, divert rivers etc, fun !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level editor allows you to :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify landscapes and the fluids will update in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add simulated fluid sources that will follow the landscape. (Water and\u00a0 Lava,)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add large volumes of liquids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the landscape auto material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint trees and grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place objects that interact with the fluids - rocks, buildings, bridges, floatable objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add lights, particle effects, volumetric fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the time of day and weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place enemies like drones, turrets, monsters etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your creation on foot, on horseback, in an aircraft, wheeled vehicles, boats, submarines, snowmobile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add premade railways.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create rivers, seas, lakes, and Volcanos.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add drains to control the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create dams then burst them or divert the fluid anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import terrain heightmaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import 3d models, .Obj, .GLB, .fbx, etc. move, scale and rotate them. basic animation support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your creations .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546500?t=1772915417","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546500/1dd95488d346fbd24b415418dc4d2fe5878ec726/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772915417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546500/c2ec28b468affbe4231bad6f8ce9639680ccb7ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772915417","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546500/c2ec28b468affbe4231bad6f8ce9639680ccb7ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772915417","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Latest news</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Demo coming soon!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cascade is a game which has interactive simulated fluids and landscapes you can modify while on a mission or in the level editor. Use aircraft, boats, wheeled vehicles, horses, snowmobiles, Choose a creative mode or an mission driven path with challenges that include drones, turrets, monsters, bases to attack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are single player missions that involve first person characters, horse back, aircraft, driving, boats and more. these involve\u00a0 challenges of exploration, quests, attack, divert rivers etc, fun !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level editor allows you to :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify landscapes and the fluids will update in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add simulated fluid sources that will follow the landscape. (Water and\u00a0 Lava,)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add large volumes of liquids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the landscape auto material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint trees and grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place objects that interact with the fluids - rocks, buildings, bridges, floatable objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add lights, particle effects, volumetric fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the time of day and weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place enemies like drones, turrets, monsters etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your creation on foot, on horseback, in an aircraft, wheeled vehicles, boats, submarines, snowmobile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add premade railways.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create rivers, seas, lakes, and Volcanos.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add drains to control the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create dams then burst them or divert the fluid anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import terrain heightmaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import 3d models, .Obj, .GLB, .fbx, etc. move, scale and rotate them. basic animation support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your creations .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Cascade Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546500/aa4850efa94776d492c1a70623438fdbb48edebf/header.jpg?t=1772915417","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<s